PROJECT: Ethereum

## Ecosystem Position

Primary Sector: Smart contract platform / Layer 1 blockchain (HIGH) [Ethereum.org, https://ethereum.org/en/what-is-ethereum/]
Secondary Sector: Settlement layer untuk Layer 2 scaling, DeFi, NFT, DAO, infrastructure (HIGH) [Electric Capital Developer Report 2024, https://www.electriccapital.com/developer-report; DefiLlama Ethereum, https://defillama.com/chain/Ethereum]
Primary Chain: Ethereum Mainnet (L1) (HIGH) [Ethereum.org - Networks, https://ethereum.org/en/developers/docs/networks/]
Supported Chains: Sepolia (testnet); Holesky (testnet); Ethereum Classic (ETC) — chain terpisah hasil DAO fork; berbagai L2 (Arbitrum, Optimism, Base, Linea, Scroll, zkSync, Starknet, Mantle, Blast, Mode, dll.) yang settle ke Ethereum L1 (HIGH) [Ethereum.org - Networks, https://ethereum.org/en/developers/docs/networks/; L2Beat, https://l2beat.com/; Sepolia, https://sepolia.dev/; Holesky, https://holesky.ethpandaops.io/]
Sources: https://ethereum.org/en/what-is-ethereum/ ; https://electriccapital.com/developer-report ; https://defillama.com/chain/Ethereum ; https://ethereum.org/en/developers/docs/networks/ ; https://l2beat.com/ ; https://sepolia.dev/ ; https://holesky.ethpandaops.io/

## External Dependencies

Dependency Name: Infura
Dependency Type: Infrastructure
Purpose: Penyedia RPC endpoint dan API node Ethereum terkelola; backbone akses jaringan untuk dApp, wallet, L2, dan indexer
Criticality: Critical
Status: Live
Related Entity: Infura
Related Technology Component: JSON-RPC endpoint (eth_* methods), WebSocket, Archive node access
Sources: https://www.infura.io/ ; https://consensys.net/blog/infura/infura-joins-consensys/ ; https://messari.io/project/infura/profile

Dependency Name: Alchemy
Dependency Type: Infrastructure
Purpose: Penyedia platform pengembang dan Enhanced APIs (NFT API, Notify, Transact); infrastruktur RPC alternatif utama
Criticality: Critical
Status: Live
Related Entity: Alchemy
Related Technology Component: JSON-RPC endpoint, Enhanced APIs, Webhook/Notify
Sources: https://www.alchemy.com/ ; https://messari.io/project/alchemy/profile ; https://www.theblock.co/post/2022/alchemy-valuation

Dependency Name: Flashbots (MEV-Boost)
Dependency Type: Protocol / Service
Purpose: MEV-Boost relay/builder network untuk Proposer-Builder Separation (PBS); >90% blok Ethereum dibangun via MEV-Boost; mitigasi MEV dan transparansi
Criticality: Critical
Status: Live
Related Entity: Flashbots
Related Technology Component: MEV-Boost client, Builder API, Relay, PBS (Proposer-Builder Separation)
Sources: https://flashbots.net/ ; https://github.com/flashbots/mev-boost ; https://mevboost.pics/ ; https://github.com/flashbots/mev-boost-specs

Dependency Name: Lido Finance (stETH)
Dependency Type: Protocol / Service
Purpose: Liquid staking token terbesar (stETH) mewakili >25% total ETH staked; memungkinkan staking tanpa 32 ETH minimum dan menjaga likuiditas
Criticality: High
Status: Live
Related Entity: Lido Finance (tidak tercantum di Phase 2 sebagai entity terpisah — dicatat di Open Threads)
Related Technology Component: stETH contract, withdrawal credentials 0x01, Node Operator registry
Sources: https://lido.fi/ ; https://www.rated.network/ ; https://beaconcha.in/

Dependency Name: Coinbase (cbETH, Validator Operations)
Dependency Type: Exchange / Service
Purpose: Penyedia liquid staking token cbETH; operator validator institusional besar; custodian ETH untuk staking institut
Criticality: High
Status: Live
Related Entity: Coinbase (tidak tercantum di Phase 2 — dicatat di Open Threads)
Related Technology Component: cbETH contract, validator operations, custody
Sources: https://www.coinbase.com/cloud/staking ; https://www.rated.network/

Dependency Name: Oracle Providers (Chainlink, Pyth, RedStone, API3)
Dependency Type: Oracle
Purpose: Data feed off-chain (harga, randomness, dll.) untuk smart contract DeFi; Chainlink dominan untuk price feeds
Criticality: High
Status: Live
Related Entity: Chainlink (tidak tercantum di Phase 2 — dicatat di Open Threads)
Related Technology Component: Price feed contracts, VRF, CCIP, Data Streams
Sources: https://chain.link/ ; https://pyth.network/ ; https://redstone.finance/ ; https://api3.org/ ; https://defillama.com/oracles

Dependency Name: Hyperledger Foundation (Besu)
Dependency Type: Organization / Infrastructure
Purpose: Rumah organisasi proyek Hyperledger Besu (klien eksekusi Java enterprise-grade); tata kelola, lisensi Apache 2.0, CI/CD
Criticality: Medium
Status: Live
Related Entity: Hyperledger Foundation (Linux Foundation)
Related Technology Component: Besu execution client, permissioning, privacy features
Sources: https://www.hyperledger.org/projects/besu ; https://github.com/hyperledger/besu ; https://www.linuxfoundation.org/

Dependency Name: Cloud Providers (AWS, Google Cloud, Azure, DigitalOcean, Hetzner, OVH)
Dependency Type: Cloud
Purpose: Hosting untuk execution/consensus client nodes, validator infrastructure, RPC providers, indexer, archive nodes
Criticality: High
Status: Live
Related Entity: Tidak tercantum di Phase 2 (provider cloud umum) — dicatat di Open Threads
Related Technology Component: Virtual machines, bare metal, Kubernetes clusters, load balancers, managed blockchain services (AWS Managed Blockchain, Google Cloud Blockchain Node Engine)
Sources: https://aws.amazon.com/blockchain/ ; https://cloud.google.com/blockchain-node-engine ; https://azure.microsoft.com/en-us/solutions/blockchain/ ; https://www.digitalocean.com/ ; https://www.hetzner.com/ ; https://www.ovhcloud.com/

Dependency Name: libp2p / devp2p
Dependency Type: Protocol / Networking
Purpose: Networking layer consensus (libp2p, GossipSub) dan execution (devp2p, RLPx) untuk P2P gossip, discovery, sync
Criticality: Critical
Status: Live
Related Entity: Protocol Labs (libp2p), Ethereum Foundation (devp2p specs)
Related Technology Component: GossipSub, discovery v5, DHT, RLPx transport
Sources: https://github.com/libp2p/specs ; https://github.com/ethereum/devp2p ; https://github.com/prysmaticlabs/prysm/tree/master/libp2p ; https://github.com/ethereum/go-ethereum/tree/master/p2p

Dependency Name: KZG Trusted Setup (EIP-4844)
Dependency Type: Cryptography / Ceremony
Purpose: Trusted setup ceremony untuk KZG commitments digunakan blob transactions (EIP-4844); ribuan kontributor menghasilkan SRS (Structured Reference String)
Criticality: Critical (untuk blob data availability)
Status: Completed (ceremony 2023), Live (on-chain verification)
Related Entity: Ethereum Foundation, Ethereum Community (kontributor ceremony)
Related Technology Component: Blob transactions, KZG commitments, blob gas market
Sources: https://ceremony.ethereum.org/ ; https://eips.ethereum.org/EIPS/eip-4844 ; https://blog.ethereum.org/2023/01/17/kzg-ceremony-launch

Dependency Name: OpenZeppelin Contracts
Dependency Type: SDK / Library
Purpose: Library kontrak standar (ERC20, ERC721, Ownable, AccessControl, Upgradeable) digunakan ribuan proyek; standar de facto keamanan
Criticality: High
Status: Live
Related Entity: OpenZeppelin
Related Technology Component: ERC20, ERC721, ERC1155, Ownable, AccessControl, UUPS/Transparent Proxy, Defender
Sources: https://github.com/OpenZeppelin/openzeppelin-contracts ; https://docs.openzeppelin.com/contracts/ ; https://www.openzeppelin.com/

Dependency Name: Etherscan / Blockscout
Dependency Type: Data Provider / Explorer
Purpose: Block explorer, API on-chain data, contract verification, token tracker; indexer utama untuk pengguna dan developer
Criticality: High
Status: Live
Related Entity: Etherscan (tidak tercantum di Phase 2 — dicatat di Open Threads), Blockscout (tidak tercantum — dicatat di Open Threads)
Related Technology Component: REST API, WebSocket, contract verification, token info, internal transactions
Sources: https://etherscan.io/ ; https://blockscout.com/eth/mainnet/ ; https://eth.blockscout.com/

Dependency Name: The Graph
Dependency Type: Data Provider / Indexing
Purpose: Decentralized indexing protocol untuk query data on-chain via GraphQL; subgraph untuk DeFi, NFT, DAO, dll.
Criticality: Medium
Status: Live
Related Entity: The Graph (tidak tercantum di Phase 2 — dicatat di Open Threads)
Related Technology Component: Subgraph, GraphQL API, Indexer network, Curator, Delegator
Sources: https://thegraph.com/ ; https://github.com/graphprotocol/ ; https://messari.io/project/the-graph/profile

Dependency Name: Kurtosis
Dependency Type: Developer Tools / Testing
Purpose: Multi-container testnet orchestration untuk integration testing network upgrades; digunakan EF dan client teams
Criticality: Medium
Status: Live
Related Entity: Kurtosis (tidak tercantum di Phase 2 — dicatat di Open Threads)
Related Technology Component: Kurtosis enclaves, Ethereum package, network simulation
Sources: https://github.com/kurtosis-tech/kurtosis ; https://github.com/ethpandaops/kurtosis-ethereum

Dependency Name: Portal Network
Dependency Type: Protocol / Infrastructure
Purpose: Lightweight P2P network untuk history/state access (history expiry EIP-4444); alternatif full node untuk light client
Criticality: Low (belum production)
Status: Planned / Development
Related Entity: Ethereum Foundation, Portal Network contributors
Related Technology Component: Portal wire protocol, history network, state network, gossip network
Sources: https://github.com/ethereum/portal-network-specs ; https://ethereum.org/en/roadmap/state-expiry/

## Major Integrations

Integration Name: Arbitrum One (Arbitrum Rollup)
Integrated With: Offchain Labs / Arbitrum Foundation
Purpose: Optimistic rollup L2 dengan fraud proof; settle ke Ethereum L1; kompatibel EVM; terbesar TVL L2
Status: Live
Related Historical Event ID: EV-028 (Dencun upgrade mengaktifkan blob space untuk L2)
Sources: https://arbitrum.io/ ; https://l2beat.com/scaling/arbitrum ; https://blog.ethereum.org/2024/03/13/dencun-announcement

Integration Name: OP Mainnet (Optimism)
Integrated With: OP Labs / Optimism Foundation
Purpose: Optimistic rollup L2 (OP Stack); settle ke Ethereum L1; Superchain vision; Base, Mode, Mantle, dll. menggunakan OP Stack
Status: Live
Related Historical Event ID: EV-028 (Dencun upgrade mengaktifkan blob space untuk L2)
Sources: https://www.optimism.io/ ; https://l2beat.com/scaling/optimism ; https://blog.ethereum.org/2024/03/13/dencun-announcement

Integration Name: Base
Integrated With: Coinbase
Purpose: L2 berbasis OP Stack (Optimism); incubate oleh Coinbase; settle ke Ethereum L1; ekosistem consumer/app focus
Status: Live
Related Historical Event ID: EV-028 (Dencun upgrade mengaktifkan blob space untuk L2)
Sources: https://base.org/ ; https://l2beat.com/scaling/base ; https://blog.ethereum.org/2024/03/13/dencun-announcement

Integration Name: Linea
Integrated With: Consensys
Purpose: zkEVM rollup L2 (Type 2 zkEVM); settle ke Ethereum L1; integrasi native MetaMask, Infura; Consensys-backed
Status: Live
Related Historical Event ID: EV-028 (Dencun upgrade mengaktifkan blob space untuk L2)
Sources: https://linea.build/ ; https://l2beat.com/scaling/linea ; https://consensys.net/linea/ ; https://blog.ethereum.org/2024/03/13/dencun-announcement

Integration Name: zkSync Era
Integrated With: Matter Labs
Purpose: zkEVM rollup L2 (Type 4 zkEVM); settle ke Ethereum L1; account abstraction native; compiler LLVM-based
Status: Live
Related Historical Event ID: EV-028 (Dencun upgrade mengaktifkan blob space untuk L2)
Sources: https://zksync.io/ ; https://l2beat.com/scaling/zksync-era ; https://blog.ethereum.org/2024/03/13/dencun-announcement

Integration Name: Scroll
Integrated With: Scroll Foundation
Purpose: zkEVM rollup L2 (Type 2 zkEVM, bytecode-level compatibility); settle ke Ethereum L1; focus EVM equivalence
Status: Live
Related Historical Event ID: EV-028 (Dencun upgrade mengaktifkan blob space untuk L2)
Sources: https://scroll.io/ ; https://l2beat.com/scaling/scroll ; https://blog.ethereum.org/2024/03/13/dencun-announcement

Integration Name: Starknet
Integrated With: StarkWare
Purpose: Validity rollup (ZK-STARK) dengan Cairo VM; tidak EVM-equivalent (native Cairo); settle ke Ethereum L1; high throughput
Status: Live
Related Historical Event ID: EV-028 (Dencun upgrade mengaktifkan blob space untuk L2)
Sources: https://starknet.io/ ; https://l2beat.com/scaling/starknet ; https://blog.ethereum.org/2024/03/13/dencun-announcement

Integration Name: Polygon PoS / Polygon zkEVM
Integrated With: Polygon Labs
Purpose: Polygon PoS (sidechain dengan checkpoint ke Ethereum) dan Polygon zkEVM (Type 1 zkEVM); settle/bridge ke Ethereum L1
Status: Live
Related Historical Event ID: EV-028 (Dencun upgrade mengaktifkan blob space untuk L2)
Sources: https://polygon.technology/ ; https://l2beat.com/scaling/polygon-zkevm ; https://blog.ethereum.org/2024/03/13/dencun-announcement

Integration Name: Mantle
Integrated With: Mantle Core Contributors / BitDAO
Purpose: Optimistic rollup L2 (modular architecture, EigenDA untuk data availability); settle ke Ethereum L1; OP Stack variant
Status: Live
Related Historical Event ID: EV-028 (Dencun upgrade mengaktifkan blob space untuk L2)
Sources: https://www.mantle.xyz/ ; https://l2beat.com/scaling/mantle ; https://blog.ethereum.org/2024/03/13/dencun-announcement

Integration Name: Blast
Integrated With: Blast Foundation
Purpose: L2 dengan native yield (ETH staking yield + T-bill yield via MakerDAO); settle ke Ethereum L1; OP Stack based
Status: Live
Related Historical Event ID: EV-028 (Dencun upgrade mengaktifkan blob space untuk L2)
Sources: https://blast.io/ ; https://l2beat.com/scaling/blast ; https://blog.ethereum.org/2024/03/13/dencun-announcement

Integration Name: MetaMask (Wallet + Snaps)
Integrated With: Consensys
Purpose: Wallet non-custodial paling populer (>30M pengguna); Snaps extensibility; integrasi RPC Infura default; bridge ke L2
Status: Live
Related Historical Event ID: EV-030 (Pembentukan Consensys), EV-031 (Peluncuran Infura)
