Spot: Yes (ETH/USDC, ETH/USDT, ETH/DAI, ETH/WBTC, dll. — semua pair permissionless)
Perpetual: No (Uniswap v4 hooks memungkinkan limit order, tapi bukan perpetual native)
OTC: No (OTC via agregator seperti CoW Swap, 1inch, Matcha)
Launchpool: No
Status: Live
Sources: https://app.uniswap.org/ ; https://github.com/Uniswap/v4-core ; https://www.coinbase.com/price/ethereum (DEX liquidity reference)

Exchange: Curve Finance (DEX)
Listing Status: Listed (permissionless)
Spot: Yes (stETH/ETH, rETH/ETH, cbETH/ETH, frxETH/ETH, ETH/USDC, dll. — stable/LST pools)
Perpetual: No
OTC: No
Launchpool: No
Status: Live
Sources: https://curve.fi/ ; https://dao.curve.fi/ ; https://www.lido.fi/ (stETH pool reference)

## Wallet Ecosystem

Wallet: MetaMask
Support Type: Non-custodial browser extension + mobile; EVM-compatible; Snaps extensibility; Infura RPC default; Hardware wallet support (Ledger, Trezor, GridPlus, Keystone); Account Abstraction (ERC-4337 via Snaps, EIP-7702 future)
Status: Live
Sources: https://metamask.io/ ; https://snaps.metamask.io/ ; https://consensys.net/metamask/ ; https://metamask.io/hardware-wallets/

Wallet: Rainbow Wallet
Support Type: Non-custodial mobile (iOS/Android); EVM multi-chain; NFT display; Social features; Hardware wallet support (Ledger); AA experimental
Status: Live
Sources: https://rainbow.me/ ; https://github.com/rainbow-me/rainbow

Wallet: Coinbase Wallet
Support Type: Non-custodial browser extension + mobile; Multi-chain (EVM + Solana + Bitcoin); Coinbase exchange integration; Smart wallet (AA); dApp browser
Status: Live
Sources: https://www.coinbase.com/wallet ; https://www.coinbase.com/wallet/smart-wallet

Wallet: Rabby Wallet
Support Type: Non-custodial browser extension; Multi-chain EVM; Transaction simulation; Hardware wallet support (Ledger, Trezor, GridPlus, Keystone); Power user focus
Status: Live
Sources: https://rabby.io/ ; https://github.com/DeBankDeFi/rabby-wallet

Wallet: Frame
Support Type: Non-custodial desktop (macOS/Windows/Linux) + browser companion; Hardware wallet native (Ledger, Trezor, GridPlus, Keystone); EVM; Transaction simulation; Privacy focus
Status: Live
Sources: https://frame.sh/ ; https://github.com/frameth/frame

Wallet: Ledger (Hardware)
Support Type: Hardware wallet (Nano S Plus, Nano X, Stax, Flex); Ledger Live app; Ethereum app; Blind signing protection; ERC-20/NFT support; Staking via Ledger Live (Lido, Kiln, Figment)
Status: Live
Sources: https://www.ledger.com/ ; https://www.ledger.com/ethereum-wallet ; https://www.ledger.com/staking

Wallet: Trezor (Hardware)
Support Type: Hardware wallet (Model One, Safe 3, Safe 5); Trezor Suite; Ethereum support; Shamir backup; Passphrase; Staking via Trezor Suite (EigenLayer, Kiln, etc.)
Status: Live
Sources: https://trezor.io/ ; https://trezor.io/coins/ETH ; https://suite.trezor.io/

Wallet: Safe (Gnosis Safe)
Support Type: Smart contract wallet multi-sig; Safe{Wallet} web/mobile; Safe{Core} SDK; Modules (Social Recovery, Sign Message, etc.); Account Abstraction entry point (ERC-4337, EIP-7702)
Status: Live
Sources: https://safe.global/ ; https://github.com/safe-global/ ; https://docs.safe.global/

Wallet: Argent
Support Type: Smart contract wallet (Account Abstraction native); zkSync Era L2 focus; Social recovery; Guardian; DeFi integrations; Argent X (Starknet)
Status: Live
Sources: https://www.argent.xyz/ ; https://github.com/argentlabs/

Wallet: Braavos
Support Type: Smart contract wallet (Account Abstraction); Starknet native; Hardware signer support; Social recovery; Multi-call; Session keys
Status: Live
Sources: https://braavos.app/ ; https://github.com/braavos-wallet/

Wallet: Trust Wallet
Support Type: Non-custodial mobile + browser extension; Multi-chain (EVM + non-EVM); Binance ecosystem; Staking; dApp browser; Hardware wallet support (Ledger)
Status: Live
Sources: https://trustwallet.com/ ; https://github.com/trustwallet/

Wallet: Phantom
Support Type: Non-custodial browser extension + mobile; Multi-chain (Solana, Ethereum, Polygon, Bitcoin); NFT focus; Hardware wallet support (Ledger)
Status: Live
Sources: https://phantom.app/ ; https://github.com/phantom/

## Developer Ecosystem

SDK: Hardhat
Description: Development environment, testing, deployment, local network (Hardhat Network); TypeScript/JavaScript; plugin ecosystem; forking mainnet
Sources: https://hardhat.org/ ; https://github.com/NomicFoundation/hardhat ; https://hardhat.org/hardhat-runner/docs/plugins

SDK: Foundry
Description: Rust-based toolchain (forge, cast, anvil, chisel); fast testing, fuzzing, invariant testing, cheatcodes; Solidity scripting; Anvil local testnet
Sources: https://github.com/foundry-rs/foundry ; https://book.getfoundry.sh/ ; https://github.com/foundry-rs/forge-std

SDK: ethers.js / viem
Description: Library interaksi Ethereum (RPC, wallet, contract, utils, ENS); viem: type-safe, modular, modern alternative; ethers.js: established, v6 modular
Sources: https://github.com/ethers-io/ethers.js ; https://viem.sh/ ; https://docs.ethers.org/v6/

SDK: web3.py
Description: Python library untuk Ethereum JSON-RPC; async support; middleware; testing utilities; integration dengan Brownie, Ape
Sources: https://github.com/ethereum/web3.py ; https://web3py.readthedocs.io/

SDK: OpenZeppelin Contracts
Description: Library kontrak standar (ERC20, ERC721, ERC1155, Ownable, AccessControl, UUPS/Transparent Proxy, Governor, TimelockController)
Sources: https://github.com/OpenZeppelin/openzeppelin-contracts ; https://docs.openzeppelin.com/contracts/ ; https://www.openzeppelin.com/contracts

SDK: Solmate
Description: Gas-optimized contract library (ERC20, ERC721, ERC1155, Auth, Owned, ReentrancyGuard); minimal, assembly-optimized
Sources: https://github.com/transmissions11/solmate ; https://solmate.io/

SDK: Forge Standard Library (forge-std)
Description: Testing utilities untuk Foundry (console.log, cheatcodes vm.*, stdError, stdStorage, stdMath, test helpers)
Sources: https://github.com/foundry-rs/forge-std ; https://book.getfoundry.sh/reference/forge-std/

SDK: Solady
Description: Gas-optimized Solidity library (Vector, ERC20, ERC721, FixedPointMath, LibBitmap, sorting);.Vector gebrauchs heavily used di Uniswap v4
Sources: https://github.com/Vectorized/solady ; https://solady.io/

API: Infura API
Description: JSON-RPC (eth_*, debug_*, trace_*), WebSocket, Archive, NFT API, Gas API, Web3 API; rate-limited tiers
Sources: https://www.infura.io/docs ; https://docs.infura.io/

API: Alchemy API
Description: JSON-RPC (Enhanced), NFT API, Token API, Transact API, Notify (webhooks), Subgraphs, Account Abstraction SDK, Gas Manager
Sources: https://docs.alchemy.com/ ; https://www.alchemy.com/docs

API: QuickNode API
Description: JSON-RPC, Core API (token, NFT, transaction), Streams (real-time), Functions (serverless), IPFS gateway
Sources: https://www.quicknode.com/docs ; https://www.quicknode.com/docs/ethereum

API: The Graph API
Description: GraphQL endpoint untuk subgraph (Uniswap, Aave, ENS, dll.); Hosted Service (legacy) + Decentralized Network (Sunrise); Gateway
Sources: https://thegraph.com/docs/ ; https://thegraph.com/docs/en/developer/create-subgraph-hosted/ ; https://thegraph.com/blog/sunrise-upgrade

API: Etherscan API
Description: REST API untuk accounts, transactions, blocks, contracts, tokens, logs, gas tracker, contract verification; rate-limited
Sources: https://docs.etherscan.io/ ; https://etherscan.io/apis

API: Blockscout API
Description: REST API open-source explorer; accounts, transactions, blocks, tokens, contracts, stats; self-hostable
Sources: https://docs.blockscout.com/ ; https://github.com/blockscout/blockscout

Developer Tools: Foundry (forge, cast, anvil, chisel)
Description: Sudah tercantum di SDK; anvil = local testnet dengan fork mainnet, time travel, state manipulation, impersonation
Sources: https://book.getfoundry.sh/reference/anvil/ ; https://book.getfoundry.sh/cheatcodes/

Developer Tools: Tenderly
Description: Debugging, simulation, monitoring, gas profiler, transaction simulator, fork mainnet, alerting, CI/CD integration
Sources: https://tenderly.co/ ; https://docs.tenderly.co/

Developer Tools: Kurtosis
Description: Multi-container testnet orchestration; Ethereum package untuk network upgrades testing; deterministic environments
Sources: https://github.com/kurtosis-tech/kurtosis ; https://github.com/ethpandaops/kurtosis-ethereum

Developer Tools: Slither
Description: Static analysis framework (Trail of Bits); vulnerability detection; printer; detector; Crytic integration
Sources: https://github.com/crytic/slither ; https://www.trailofbits.com/ ; https://slither.readthedocs.io/

Developer Tools: Echidna
Description: Fuzzing/property-based testing untuk smart contracts (Trail of Bits); grammar-based fuzzing; corpus collection
Sources: https://github.com/crytic/echidna ; https://www.trailofbits.com/ ; https://echidna.readthedocs.io/

Developer Tools: Certora Prover
Description: Formal verification tool untuk smart contracts; CVL (Certora Verification Language); prover cloud; CI/CD integration
Sources: https://www.certora.com/ ; https://docs.certora.com/ ; https://github.com/Certora/Projects

Developer Tools: Ape (ApeWorx)
Description: Python-based development framework; plugin architecture; testing, deployment, scripting; integration dengan web3.py, Brownie-style
Sources: https://github.com/ApeWorX/ape ; https://docs.apeworx.io/

Developer Tools: Brownie
Description: Python-based framework (legacy, maintenance mode); testing, deployment, console; digantikan Foundry/Hardhat/Ape
Sources: https://github.com/eth-brownie/brownie ; https://eth-brownie.readthedocs.io/

Developer Tools: Solidity (solc)
Description: Compiler Solidity (C++); Yul intermediate representation; optimizer; via npm (solcjs), Docker, binary; version management (svm, foundryup)
Sources: https://github.com/ethereum/solidity ; https://docs.soliditylang.org/ ; https://soliditylang.org/

Developer Tools: Vyper
Description: Pythonic smart contract language; formal verification friendly; compiler Python-based; security-focused; limited features vs Solidity
Sources: https://github.com/vyperlang/vyper ; https://vyper.readthedocs.io/ ; https://vyper.fyi/

Developer Tools: Yul
Description: Intermediate language untuk inline assembly, optimizer; digunakan solc optimizer; low-level EVM control
Sources: https://docs.soliditylang.org/en/latest/yul.html ; https://github.com/ethereum/solidity/tree/develop/yul

Open Source Repository: Ethereum GitHub Organization
Description: Repositori utama protokol: go-ethereum (Geth), consensus-specs, execution-specs, execution-apis, consensus-apis, EIPs, yellowpaper, devp2p, portal-network-specs
Sources: https://github.com/ethereum ; https://github.com/ethereum/go-ethereum ; https://github.com/ethereum/consensus-specs ; https://github.com/ethereum/execution-specs ; https://github.com/ethereum/EIPs

Open Source Repository: Client Repositories
Description: Geth (go-ethereum), Besu (hyperledger/besu), Nethermind (NethermindEth/nethermind), Erigon (ledgerwatch/erigon), Prysm (prysmaticlabs/prysm), Lighthouse (sigp/lighthouse), Teku (Consensys/teku), Nimbus (status-im/nimbus-eth2), Lodestar (ChainSafe/lodestar), Reth (paradigmxyz/reth)
Sources: https://github.com/ethereum/go-ethereum ; https://github.com/hyperledger/besu ; https://github.com/NethermindEth/nethermind ; https://github.com/ledgerwatch/erigon ; https://github.com/prysmaticlabs/prysm ; https://github.com/sigp/lighthouse ; https://github.com/Consensys/teku ; https://github.com/status-im/nimbus-eth2 ; https://github.com/ChainSafe/lodestar ; https://github.com/paradigmxyz/reth

Open Source Repository: Tooling Repositories
Description: Hardhat (NomicFoundation/hardhat), Foundry (foundry-rs/foundry), ethers.js (ethers-io/ethers.js), viem (wevm/viem), web3.py (ethereum/web3.py), OpenZeppelin Contracts (OpenZeppelin/openzeppelin-contracts), Slither (crytic/slither), Echidna (crytic/echidna), Kurtosis (kurtosis-tech/kurtosis)
Sources: https://github.com/NomicFoundation/hardhat ; https://github.com/foundry-rs/foundry ; https://github.com/ethers-io/ethers.js ; https://github.com/wevm/viem ; https://github.com/ethereum/web3.py ; https://github.com/OpenZeppelin/openzeppelin-contracts ; https://github.com/crytic/slither ; https://github.com/crytic/echidna ; https://github.com/kurtosis-tech/kurtosis

