## Applications

Application: Uniswap
Category: DEX / AMM
Relationship: Deployed on Ethereum Mainnet + L2 (Arbitrum, Optimism, Base, Polygon, Celo, BNB Chain); core liquidity venue; UNI governance token; hook-based v4
Status: Live
Sources: https://uniswap.org/ ; https://app.uniswap.org/ ; https://github.com/Uniswap ; https://l2beat.com/scaling/summary

Application: Aave
Category: Lending / Money Market
Relationship: Deployed on Ethereum Mainnet + L2 (Arbitrum, Optimism, Base, Polygon, Avalanche, Metis, Scroll); GHO stablecoin; Aave V3; safety module
Status: Live
Sources: https://aave.com/ ; https://app.aave.com/ ; https://github.com/aave ; https://l2beat.com/scaling/summary

Application: MakerDAO / Sky
Category: Stablecoin / CDP / DeFi
Relationship: Deployed on Ethereum Mainnet + L2 (Arbitrum, Optimism); DAI/USDS stablecoin; Spark lending; SubDAOs; Endgame; RWA collateral
Status: Live
Sources: https://makerdao.com/ ; https://sky.money/ ; https://spark.fi/ ; https://endgame.makerdao.com/

Application: Lido Finance
Category: Liquid Staking
Relationship: Deployed on Ethereum Mainnet (stETH, wstETH); L2 bridges (Arbitrum, Optimism, zkSync, Polygon, Mantle); DVT integration (Obol, SSV); Node Operator registry
Status: Live
Sources: https://lido.fi/ ; https://stake.lido.fi/ ; https://www.rated.network/ ; https://obol.tech/ ; https://ssv.network/

Application: EigenLayer
Category: Restaking
Relationship: Deployed on Ethereum Mainnet; restaking ETH/stETH; AVS (Actively Validated Services); EigenDA (data availability); operator delegation
Status: Live (mainnet April 2024)
Sources: https://www.eigenlayer.xyz/ ; https://docs.eigenlayer.xyz/ ; https://www.rated.network/

Application: Curve Finance
Category: DEX / Stablecoin AMM
Relationship: Deployed on Ethereum Mainnet + L2; stETH/ETH, rETH/ETH, crvUSD stablecoin; DAO governance; gauge voting; LlamaRisk
Status: Live
Sources: https://curve.fi/ ; https://dao.curve.fi/ ; https://crv.usd/ ; https://github.com/curvefi/

Application: Balancer
Category: DEX / Weighted Pool / Vault
